OL,3,GNEWSASir Ed Davey sets out Lib Dems'
OL,4,Apitch to London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe party conference season is under
OL,7,Fway - with the Liberal Democrats
OL,8,Fmeeting in Brighton from Sunday.
OL,10,FBBC London's political editor Karl
OL,11,FMercer is sitting down with leaders and
OL,12,Fother senior party figures to discuss
OL,13,Fsome of the key issues facing the
OL,14,Fcapital and what their party might do
OL,15,Fto tackle them.
OL,17,FEarlier this week he spoke to Lib Dem
OL,18,Fleader Sir Ed Davey, and asked about
OL,19,Fthe party's performance in May's local
OL,20,Felections and its prospects in London
OL,21,Fat the next general election.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
